  "finalText": "Both issues were correct, and I've fixed them. The system date reads 2026-07-25, so I used that. Before changing anything I re-read the receipts, orders and policy updates.\n\n- **RMA-807 (O-8007 L1, P-HDP):**\n  - The warehouse logged 1 resellable unit on 07-25.\n  - The return was requested 07-20, the last day PU-21 is in force, so no restocking fee applies.\n  - It was requested 12 days after shipping, so the refund goes to card.\n  - I refunded 15,900 by card and restocked 1 P-HDP as sellable (stock 9 to 10).\n  - I closed the RMA.\n- **RMA-816 (O-8016 L1, P-MOU):**\n  - The warehouse logged 1 resellable unit on 07-25.\n  - The return was requested 07-21, after PU-21 ended, so the 15% fee applies.\n  - The 735 fee comes off the 4,900 paid, so I refunded 4,165 by card.\n  - I restocked 1 P-MOU as sellable (stock 21 to 22).\n  - I closed the RMA.\n\nI touched nothing else. RMA-809 is still open for its missing cable, and RMA-808 is still under investigation.",
